    "about.desc2": 'kcore grew out of our infrastructure work. We kept running into the same problem: managing VMs on bare metal was either too manual or required buying into a heavyweight platform. So we built something that fits how we actually work &mdash; declarative, API-driven, and simple enough to run on a single node or scale across many.',
